---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About">
  <div class="about-page">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-hero">
        <div class="about-badge">About the Series</div>
        <h1>Precious Fix My Life</h1>
        <p class="lead">Self-help written for real people — not for the guru-obsessed or the chronically motivated. Just people who want their lives to work better, starting today.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-body">
        <h2>Why These Books Exist</h2>
        <p>Most self-help books are written by people who've never lived a normal life. They're written from a stage, not a kitchen table. Precious Fix My Life was created to give practical, immediately usable guidance — backed by real research, delivered without the fluff.</p>
        <p>Each book in the series tackles one major area of life: mindset, time, relationships, money, and habits. You can read them in any order, or start with whatever area feels most urgent right now.</p>

        <h2>What's Inside Each ebook</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>No filler.</strong> Every chapter serves a purpose.</li>
          <li><strong>Actionable frameworks.</strong> Not "just try harder" — actual systems you can implement today.</li>
          <li><strong>Real exercises.</strong> Written exercises, checklists, and 21-day plans you can start immediately.</li>
          <li><strong>Honest language.</strong> No toxic positivity. No life-hack culture. Just honest guidance.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>The Author</h2>
        <p>Precious Fix My Life is a self-help series built for people who are serious about creating real change — not through inspiration, but through action. Every book is researched, structured, and written to be as practical as possible.</p>

        <h2>Get in Touch</h2>
        <p>Questions, feedback, or collaboration inquiries? Email us at <a href="mailto:precious.santana@yahoo.com">precious.santana@yahoo.com</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .about-page { padding: 60px 0; }
  .about-hero {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6B4EFF 0%, #9B7DFF 100%);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 60px;
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 60px;
  }
  .about-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    padding: 6px 16px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .about-hero h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .lead {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    max-width: 540px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }
  .about-body { max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .about-body h2 { font-size: 1.3rem; margin: 36px 0 14px; font-weight: 700; }
  .about-body p { color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .about-body ul { list-style: none; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .about-body li { padding: 8px 0; color: var(--color-text-muted); }
  .about-body li strong { color: var(--color-text); }
  .about-body a { color: var(--color-primary); }
</style>